flowchart LR
    A["1. CASE DEFINITION<br>Data centre location, age, capacity<br>Cooling system, asset life"] --> C["3. ASSET VULNERABILITY<br>Heat thresholds, cooling efficiency<br>Redundancy and operating limits"] & E["5. FINANCIAL TRANSMISSION<br>Energy costs, lost revenue<br>Operating costs and cash flow"]
    B["2. CLIMATE HAZARD<br>Climate pathway and time horizon<br>Extreme-heat exposure"] --> C
    C --> D["4. OPERATIONAL IMPACT<br>Cooling electricity demand<br>Capacity constraints and downtime"]
    D --> E
    E --> F["6. DECISION COMPARISON<br>Maintain, retrofit, or replace<br>Intervention costs and effectiveness"]
    F --> G["OUTPUTS<br>Financial impact, residual risk<br>Cost-benefit comparison and uncertainty"]
    F -. Updated asset characteristics .-> C
    H["External data<br>Climate projections, asset benchmarks,<br>energy prices and financial parameters"] --> B & C & E & F
    I["Assumptions and uncertainty<br>Data gaps, parameter ranges,<br>sensitivity tests"] L_I_B_0@-.-> B & C & E & F

     A:::input
     C:::process
     E:::process
     B:::input
     D:::process
     F:::process
     G:::output
     H:::input
     I:::support
    classDef input fill:#e8eef8,stroke:#5474a6,color:#172b4d
    classDef process fill:#e8f3ee,stroke:#4b8b70,color:#173d2d
    classDef output fill:#f8eedc,stroke:#b58a43,color:#513a13
    classDef support fill:#f0e9f7,stroke:#9274ad,color:#38264b

